  "history": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "Old Ghost Bai Jun shows Fang Yun and Fang Leng a Gu like sapphire, the size of a small bowl, with a thick carapace dotted with countless golden star specks that twinkle. Fang Yun cries out that it is a rank eight Immortal Gu. Old Ghost Bai Jun names it Soul Beast Token and says it can directly allow him to enslave soul beasts. Soul Beast Token at rank eight can enslave immemorial soul beasts, and what it requires is not rank eight immortal essence, so he can use it now. Fang Leng takes the meaning: with an immemorial soul beast, Old Ghost Bai Jun would need to be treated as a quasi-rank eight existence, and soul beast token Immortal Gu changes everything for a plan to control green ghost desert.",
        "chapters": [
          1504
        ],
